  {
   "file_type": "document",
   "id": "baton_xvf66o",
   "label": "Dilation deep dive, 30% pupil curves, NE summaries, new NE/eye-motion uploads and a site load fix",
   "source_file": ".baton/notes/2026/10/2026-10-29-kiro-gia-huy-dilation-deep-dive-30-pupil-curves-ne-su-xvf66o.md",
   "source_location": "L1"
  },
  {
   "file_type": "rationale",
   "id": "baton_xvf66o_d1",
   "label": "The annotator's \"pupil moving speed\" columns are vertical pupil-centre position (px, 50 Hz); converted to speed as |d position|/frame after a 10 Hz low-pass, as in pupil_eye_motion.py. Confirmed by the annotator.",
   "source_file": ".baton/notes/2026/10/2026-10-29-kiro-gia-huy-dilation-deep-dive-30-pupil-curves-ne-su-xvf66o.md",
   "source_location": "L31"
  },
  {
   "file_type": "rationale",
   "id": "baton_xvf66o_d2",
   "label": "Sheet date/cycle fixes, confirmed by the annotator: \"2024.06.01\" in the scramble sheet = scramble 2025.06.01; scramble 2024.05.05 columns labelled 11-14 = cycles 10-13; the \"Gcmap8m\" sheet is RSC 2023.07.12, columns E-G = cycles 6-8.",
   "source_file": ".baton/notes/2026/10/2026-10-29-kiro-gia-huy-dilation-deep-dive-30-pupil-curves-ne-su-xvf66o.md",
   "source_location": "L32"
  },
  {
   "file_type": "rationale",
   "id": "baton_xvf66o_d3",
   "label": "NE 2026.03.10 keeps its DLC eye motion; the annotator's position columns for that day were not uploaded.",
   "source_file": ".baton/notes/2026/10/2026-10-29-kiro-gia-huy-dilation-deep-dive-30-pupil-curves-ne-su-xvf66o.md",
   "source_location": "L33"
  },
  {
   "file_type": "rationale",
   "id": "baton_xvf66o_d4",
   "label": "5-s eye-motion bins must never contain NaN motion_sum: the labeling server passes it to JSON and browsers reject NaN, so the cycle never loads. Empty bins are written as 0.",
   "source_file": ".baton/notes/2026/10/2026-10-29-kiro-gia-huy-dilation-deep-dive-30-pupil-curves-ne-su-xvf66o.md",
   "source_location": "L34"
  },
  {
   "file_type": "concept",
   "id": "baton_xvf66o_t1",
   "label": "NE 2026.05.10 NE values are ~2.8 vs ~1000 on other days (different export?); 05.08 c15 vessel jumps at ~80 s (possible ROI shift). Not yet answered.",
   "source_file": ".baton/notes/2026/10/2026-10-29-kiro-gia-huy-dilation-deep-dive-30-pupil-curves-ne-su-xvf66o.md",
   "source_location": "L37"
  },
  {
   "file_type": "concept",
   "id": "baton_xvf66o_t2",
   "label": "Labelling server itself still emits NaN for missing bin values; a server-side guard would prevent this for any future file.",
